<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Jan 09 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Jan 09 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $750.70 billion in the week to January 09 from $457.34 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     50.60		16.55</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     26.86		 8.50</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  700.10	     440.79</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    141.88		76.65</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	538.55	     319.43</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    212.15	     137.91</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
